# Local 1Password service-account token for the release lane (make testflight,
# make op-check). Optional: without a .env the lane uses interactive 1Password
# app approval instead. Setup is runbook section 2.6; the design is ADR-0016.
#
#   cp .env.example .env && chmod 600 .env     then paste the token below
#
# What it is: the token of a 1Password service account. Scope that account
# read-only to the OpenMoji vault and nothing else.
#
# scripts/op-run.sh reads ONLY the OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN line below, hands it
# to `op` through the environment (never argv, never echoed), and refuses the
# file unless only you can read it (mode 600). Format: one line, no spaces, no
# trailing comment.
#
# .env is git-ignored. NEVER commit it, and never paste the token into an
# issue, PR, bead comment, chat or log.
OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN=
